# taskforge-web/pages — EAV port (apps/taskforge-web/pages, semsc v0.1).
#
# The three server-rendered page handlers — landing, dashboard, 404 — each
# composes component fragments (from the components module) into a page
# `htmlTemplate`, hydrates it through `html.render`, and writes it back via
# `http.responseText`. Converted from the v0.1 `html template`/`html.hydrate.X`/
# `components.renderX` forms. Part of the multi-module taskforge-web port
# (X-043); rendering + the HTTP runtime are deferred (target webServer), so this
# parses + lints clean against standard.http / standard.html / the components
# module's exported render-operations.

appTaskforgeWebPages is module
appTaskforgeWebPages path apps.taskforgeWeb.pages
appTaskforgeWebPages imports http standard.http
appTaskforgeWebPages imports html standard.html
appTaskforgeWebPages imports components apps.taskforgeWeb.components
appTaskforgeWebPages exports homePageHandler
appTaskforgeWebPages exports dashboardPageHandler
appTaskforgeWebPages exports notFoundPageHandler
appTaskforgeWebPages purpose "Server-rendered HTML pages for TaskForge Web: landing, dashboard, and 404"
appTaskforgeWebPages invariant "Each page composes typed HtmlFragment slots into a page template and writes it via http.responseText"

HtmlDocument is alias
HtmlDocument for String
HtmlDocument purpose "A complete rendered HTML document written to the response"

HttpStatusCode is alias
HttpStatusCode for Int32
HttpStatusCode purpose "An HTTP response status code"

HttpContentType is alias
HttpContentType for String
HttpContentType purpose "An HTTP response Content-Type value"

httpResponseWriter is capability
httpResponseWriter grants write http.response
httpResponseWriter purpose "Authority to write server-rendered page bodies to the HttpResponse"

httpStatusOkLocal is storage module immutable HttpStatusCode 200
htmlContentType is storage module immutable HttpContentType "text/html; charset=utf-8"

HomePageTemplate is htmlTemplate
HomePageTemplate body html
  <!doctype html>
  <html lang="en" class="h-full antialiased">
    <head>
      {{headFragment}}
    </head>
    <body class="min-h-full text-ink-900">
      {{heroBackgroundFragment}}
      <main class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-8 sm:py-10">
        {{brandHeaderFragment}}
        <section class="mt-6 grid items-start gap-10 lg:mt-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_minmax(0,420px)] lg:gap-16">
          {{landingHeroFragment}}
          {{authCardFragment}}
        </section>
        {{featureGridFragment}}
        <section class="mt-12 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px]">
          <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-glow-soft">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-500">What you get</h3>
            <ol class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-ink-700">
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-xs font-bold text-brand-700">1</span><span><strong class="text-ink-900">Sign in</strong> with the seeded demo account or create your own - bcrypt cost-12 hashing, fresh session per login.</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-xs font-bold text-brand-700">2</span><span><strong class="text-ink-900">Land on your dashboard</strong> - a server-rendered shell that the bundled JS hydrates with your todos from the JSON API.</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-xs font-bold text-brand-700">3</span><span><strong class="text-ink-900">Add, complete, delete</strong> - every change persists to SQLite immediately, scoped to your <code class="font-mono text-xs">user_id</code> via foreign-key constraint.</span></li>
            </ol>
          </div>
          {{statusCardFragment}}
        </section>
        {{appFooterFragment}}
      </main>
      <script src="/assets/home.js" defer></script>
    </body>
  </html>

homePageHandler is operation
homePageHandler in request HttpRequest
homePageHandler in response HttpResponse
homePageHandler out Int32
homePageHandler effect write http.response
homePageHandler uses httpResponseWriter
homePageHandler memory arena request
homePageHandler async no
homePageHandler purpose "GET / — hydrate HomePageTemplate into a full HTML document and write it back as text/html"
homePageHandler invariant "Read-only: no SQL, no auth, no cookies; all dynamic holes are escaped fragment slots"
homePageHandler let homePageTitleText immutable String "TaskForge Web - Modern multi-user todos"
homePageHandler let homeProductNameText immutable String "TaskForge Web"
homePageHandler let homeTaglineText immutable String "Multi-user todos, server-rendered, securely stored."
homePageHandler let homeHeadlineText immutable String "Production-grade todos, built end-to-end in SemanticScript."
homePageHandler let homeLeadText immutable String "A full-stack web app - bcrypt-hashed auth, SQLite-backed state, typed server-rendered HTML, vanilla-JS interactivity. No client framework, no ORM, no surprises."
homePageHandler let homeVersionText immutable String "1.1.0"
homePageHandler let homeBcryptCostText immutable String "12"
homePageHandler let homeApiBaseUrlText immutable String "http://127.0.0.1:18090"
homePageHandler let homeDemoUsernameText immutable String "demo"
homePageHandler let homeDemoPasswordText immutable String "demo1234"
homePageHandler do renderHomeHeadCall
homePageHandler do renderHomeBackgroundCall
homePageHandler do renderHomeBrandCall
homePageHandler do renderHomeHeroCall
homePageHandler do renderHomeLoginPanelCall
homePageHandler do renderHomeRegisterPanelCall
homePageHandler do renderHomeAuthCardCall
homePageHandler do renderHomeFeatureGridCall
homePageHandler do renderHomeStatusCardCall
homePageHandler do renderHomeFooterCall
homePageHandler do hydrateHomePageCall
homePageHandler do writeHomePageCall
homePageHandler return writeHomePageStatus

renderHomeHeadCall is call
renderHomeHeadCall in homePageHandler
renderHomeHeadCall invokes components.renderPageShellHead
renderHomeHeadCall arg pageTitleText String homePageTitleText
renderHomeHeadCall out homeHeadFragment HtmlFragment

renderHomeBackgroundCall is call
renderHomeBackgroundCall in homePageHandler
renderHomeBackgroundCall invokes components.renderHeroBackground
renderHomeBackgroundCall out homeHeroBackgroundFragment HtmlFragment

renderHomeBrandCall is call
renderHomeBrandCall in homePageHandler
renderHomeBrandCall invokes components.renderBrandHeader
renderHomeBrandCall arg productNameText String homeProductNameText
renderHomeBrandCall arg taglineText String homeTaglineText
renderHomeBrandCall out homeBrandHeaderFragment HtmlFragment

renderHomeHeroCall is call
renderHomeHeroCall in homePageHandler
renderHomeHeroCall invokes components.renderLandingHero
renderHomeHeroCall arg productNameText String homeProductNameText
renderHomeHeroCall arg headlineText String homeHeadlineText
renderHomeHeroCall arg leadText String homeLeadText
renderHomeHeroCall out homeLandingHeroFragment HtmlFragment

renderHomeLoginPanelCall is call
renderHomeLoginPanelCall in homePageHandler
renderHomeLoginPanelCall invokes components.renderLoginPanel
renderHomeLoginPanelCall arg demoUsernameText String homeDemoUsernameText
renderHomeLoginPanelCall arg demoPasswordText String homeDemoPasswordText
renderHomeLoginPanelCall out homeLoginPanelFragment HtmlFragment

renderHomeRegisterPanelCall is call
renderHomeRegisterPanelCall in homePageHandler
renderHomeRegisterPanelCall invokes components.renderRegisterPanel
renderHomeRegisterPanelCall out homeRegisterPanelFragment HtmlFragment

renderHomeAuthCardCall is call
renderHomeAuthCardCall in homePageHandler
renderHomeAuthCardCall invokes components.renderAuthCard
renderHomeAuthCardCall arg loginPanelFragment HtmlFragment homeLoginPanelFragment
renderHomeAuthCardCall arg registerPanelFragment HtmlFragment homeRegisterPanelFragment
renderHomeAuthCardCall out homeAuthCardFragment HtmlFragment

renderHomeFeatureGridCall is call
renderHomeFeatureGridCall in homePageHandler
renderHomeFeatureGridCall invokes components.renderFeatureGrid
renderHomeFeatureGridCall out homeFeatureGridFragment HtmlFragment

renderHomeStatusCardCall is call
renderHomeStatusCardCall in homePageHandler
renderHomeStatusCardCall invokes components.renderStatusCard
renderHomeStatusCardCall arg versionText String homeVersionText
renderHomeStatusCardCall arg bcryptCostText String homeBcryptCostText
renderHomeStatusCardCall arg apiBaseUrlText String homeApiBaseUrlText
renderHomeStatusCardCall out homeStatusCardFragment HtmlFragment

renderHomeFooterCall is call
renderHomeFooterCall in homePageHandler
renderHomeFooterCall invokes components.renderAppFooter
renderHomeFooterCall out homeAppFooterFragment HtmlFragment

hydrateHomePageCall is call
hydrateHomePageCall in homePageHandler
hydrateHomePageCall invokes html.render
hydrateHomePageCall arg template HtmlTemplate HomePageTemplate
hydrateHomePageCall arg headFragment HtmlFragment homeHeadFragment
hydrateHomePageCall arg heroBackgroundFragment HtmlFragment homeHeroBackgroundFragment
hydrateHomePageCall arg brandHeaderFragment HtmlFragment homeBrandHeaderFragment
hydrateHomePageCall arg landingHeroFragment HtmlFragment homeLandingHeroFragment
hydrateHomePageCall arg authCardFragment HtmlFragment homeAuthCardFragment
hydrateHomePageCall arg featureGridFragment HtmlFragment homeFeatureGridFragment
hydrateHomePageCall arg statusCardFragment HtmlFragment homeStatusCardFragment
hydrateHomePageCall arg appFooterFragment HtmlFragment homeAppFooterFragment
hydrateHomePageCall out homePageHtml HtmlDocument

writeHomePageCall is call
writeHomePageCall in homePageHandler
writeHomePageCall invokes http.responseText
writeHomePageCall arg response HttpResponse response
writeHomePageCall arg status HttpStatusCode httpStatusOkLocal
writeHomePageCall arg body HtmlDocument homePageHtml
writeHomePageCall arg contentType HttpContentType htmlContentType
writeHomePageCall out writeHomePageStatus Int32

DashboardPageTemplate is htmlTemplate
DashboardPageTemplate body html
  <!doctype html>
  <html lang="en" class="h-full antialiased">
    <head>
      {{headFragment}}
    </head>
    <body class="min-h-full text-ink-900">
      {{heroBackgroundFragment}}
      <main class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-8 sm:py-10">
        <header class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <a href="/" class="group flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl grad-btn text-xl font-bold text-white shadow-glow-brand transition group-hover:scale-105">T</div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-900">{{productNameText}}</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-ink-500">Your personal todo workspace</div>
            </div>
          </a>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div id="userPill" class="hidden items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-ink-200 bg-white/80 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-ink-700 shadow-sm sm:flex">
              <div id="userAvatar" class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full grad-btn text-[10px] font-bold text-white">?</div>
              <span id="userPillLabel">Loading...</span>
            </div>
            <button id="logoutButton" type="button" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-ink-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-ink-700 shadow-sm transition hover:bg-ink-50 hover:shadow-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-200">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4"/><polyline points="16 17 21 12 16 7"/><line x1="21" y1="12" x2="9" y2="12"/></svg>
              Sign out
            </button>
          </div>
        </header>

        <section class="fade-up mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr]">
          <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-glow-soft sm:col-span-3 sm:row-start-1 lg:col-span-1">
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-500">Welcome back</div>
            <h1 id="welcomeLine" class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-900">Loading...</h1>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-600">Your todos sync to SQLite on every change. Sessions cookie-backed, HttpOnly + SameSite=Strict.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-glow-soft">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-500">Open</span>
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 text-brand-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div id="statOpen" class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-900">-</div>
            <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-500">awaiting your attention</div>
          </div>
          <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-glow-soft">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-500">Completed</span>
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div id="statDone" class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-900">-</div>
            <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-500">already done</div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="fade-up mt-6 glass rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-glow-soft sm:p-8">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3">
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-900">Your todos</h2>
              <p id="todoCountLine" class="mt-0.5 text-sm text-ink-500">Loading...</p>
            </div>
            <button id="newTodoButton" type="button" class="grad-btn inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-glow-brand transition hover:shadow-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-300">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
              New todo
            </button>
          </div>

          <form id="newTodoForm" class="mt-5 hidden space-y-3 rounded-2xl border border-brand-200/60 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-50/70 to-fuchsia-50/40 p-5 shadow-sm">
            <div>
              <label class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-500" for="newTodoTitle">Title</label>
              <input id="newTodoTitle" name="title" type="text" required maxlength="500" placeholder="What needs doing?" class="mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-xl border border-ink-200 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm shadow-sm focus:border-brand-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-200" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-500" for="newTodoBody">Notes <span class="font-normal normal-case text-ink-400">(optional)</span></label>
              <textarea id="newTodoBody" name="body" rows="2" maxlength="10000" placeholder="Extra context, links, sub-tasks..." class="mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-xl border border-ink-200 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm shadow-sm focus:border-brand-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-200"></textarea>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
              <label class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-500" for="newTodoPriority">Priority</label>
              <select id="newTodoPriority" name="priority" class="rounded-xl border border-ink-200 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm shadow-sm focus:border-brand-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-200">
                <option value="1">High</option>
                <option value="2" selected>Medium</option>
                <option value="3">Low</option>
              </select>
              <button id="cancelNewTodoButton" type="button" class="ml-auto rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink-500 transition hover:text-ink-700">Cancel</button>
              <button type="submit" class="grad-btn rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-glow-brand transition hover:shadow-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-300">Save todo</button>
            </div>
            <p id="newTodoResult" class="min-h-[1.25rem] text-sm"></p>
          </form>

          <ul id="todoList" class="mt-5 space-y-2.5 scroll-thin">
            <li class="rounded-2xl bg-ink-50/70 px-4 py-6 text-center text-sm text-ink-500">Loading your todos...</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        {{appFooterFragment}}
      </main>
      <script src="/assets/dashboard.js" defer></script>
    </body>
  </html>

dashboardPageHandler is operation
dashboardPageHandler in request HttpRequest
dashboardPageHandler in response HttpResponse
dashboardPageHandler out Int32
dashboardPageHandler effect write http.response
dashboardPageHandler uses httpResponseWriter
dashboardPageHandler memory arena request
dashboardPageHandler async no
dashboardPageHandler purpose "GET /dashboard — render the logged-in dashboard shell; dashboard.js fetches /api/auth/me + /api/todos"
dashboardPageHandler invariant "Server-side auth check is deferred to the API calls the page makes"
dashboardPageHandler let dashboardTitleText immutable String "TaskForge Web - Dashboard"
dashboardPageHandler let dashboardProductNameText immutable String "TaskForge Web"
dashboardPageHandler do renderDashHeadCall
dashboardPageHandler do renderDashBackgroundCall
dashboardPageHandler do renderDashFooterCall
dashboardPageHandler do hydrateDashboardCall
dashboardPageHandler do writeDashboardCall
dashboardPageHandler return writeDashboardStatus

renderDashHeadCall is call
renderDashHeadCall in dashboardPageHandler
renderDashHeadCall invokes components.renderPageShellHead
renderDashHeadCall arg pageTitleText String dashboardTitleText
renderDashHeadCall out dashHeadFragment HtmlFragment

renderDashBackgroundCall is call
renderDashBackgroundCall in dashboardPageHandler
renderDashBackgroundCall invokes components.renderHeroBackground
renderDashBackgroundCall out dashHeroBackgroundFragment HtmlFragment

renderDashFooterCall is call
renderDashFooterCall in dashboardPageHandler
renderDashFooterCall invokes components.renderAppFooter
renderDashFooterCall out dashAppFooterFragment HtmlFragment

hydrateDashboardCall is call
hydrateDashboardCall in dashboardPageHandler
hydrateDashboardCall invokes html.render
hydrateDashboardCall arg template HtmlTemplate DashboardPageTemplate
hydrateDashboardCall arg headFragment HtmlFragment dashHeadFragment
hydrateDashboardCall arg heroBackgroundFragment HtmlFragment dashHeroBackgroundFragment
hydrateDashboardCall arg productNameText String dashboardProductNameText
hydrateDashboardCall arg appFooterFragment HtmlFragment dashAppFooterFragment
hydrateDashboardCall out dashboardPageHtml HtmlDocument

writeDashboardCall is call
writeDashboardCall in dashboardPageHandler
writeDashboardCall invokes http.responseText
writeDashboardCall arg response HttpResponse response
writeDashboardCall arg status HttpStatusCode httpStatusOkLocal
writeDashboardCall arg body HtmlDocument dashboardPageHtml
writeDashboardCall arg contentType HttpContentType htmlContentType
writeDashboardCall out writeDashboardStatus Int32

NotFoundPageTemplate is htmlTemplate
NotFoundPageTemplate body html
  <!doctype html>
  <html lang="en" class="h-full antialiased">
    <head>
      {{headFragment}}
    </head>
    <body class="min-h-full text-ink-900">
      {{heroBackgroundFragment}}
      <main class="mx-auto flex max-w-xl flex-col items-center px-6 py-24 text-center">
        <div class="fade-up glass rounded-3xl p-10 shadow-glow-soft">
          <div class="mx-auto flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl grad-btn text-2xl font-bold text-white shadow-glow-brand">404</div>
          <h1 class="mt-6 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-900">Page not found</h1>
          <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-600">The URL you requested isn't part of TaskForge Web's route table. Head back to the home page or jump into your dashboard.</p>
          <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
            <a href="/" class="grad-btn inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-glow-brand transition hover:shadow-lg">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
              Home
            </a>
            <a href="/dashboard" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-ink-200 bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-700 shadow-sm transition hover:bg-ink-50 hover:shadow-md">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="9"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="5"/><rect x="14" y="12" width="7" height="9"/><rect x="3" y="16" width="7" height="5"/></svg>
              Dashboard
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </main>
    </body>
  </html>

notFoundPageHandler is operation
notFoundPageHandler in request HttpRequest
notFoundPageHandler in response HttpResponse
notFoundPageHandler out Int32
notFoundPageHandler effect write http.response
notFoundPageHandler uses httpResponseWriter
notFoundPageHandler memory arena request
notFoundPageHandler async no
notFoundPageHandler purpose "Dispatched by the not-found hook (path '*' route in the main module's table)"
notFoundPageHandler invariant "Always returns 404 + an HTML body linking back to / and /dashboard"
notFoundPageHandler let notFoundTitleText immutable String "404 - TaskForge Web"
notFoundPageHandler let notFoundStatusCode immutable HttpStatusCode 404
notFoundPageHandler do renderNotFoundHeadCall
notFoundPageHandler do renderNotFoundBackgroundCall
notFoundPageHandler do hydrateNotFoundCall
notFoundPageHandler do writeNotFoundCall
notFoundPageHandler return writeNotFoundStatus

renderNotFoundHeadCall is call
renderNotFoundHeadCall in notFoundPageHandler
renderNotFoundHeadCall invokes components.renderPageShellHead
renderNotFoundHeadCall arg pageTitleText String notFoundTitleText
renderNotFoundHeadCall out notFoundHeadFragment HtmlFragment

renderNotFoundBackgroundCall is call
renderNotFoundBackgroundCall in notFoundPageHandler
renderNotFoundBackgroundCall invokes components.renderHeroBackground
renderNotFoundBackgroundCall out notFoundHeroBackgroundFragment HtmlFragment

hydrateNotFoundCall is call
hydrateNotFoundCall in notFoundPageHandler
hydrateNotFoundCall invokes html.render
hydrateNotFoundCall arg template HtmlTemplate NotFoundPageTemplate
hydrateNotFoundCall arg headFragment HtmlFragment notFoundHeadFragment
hydrateNotFoundCall arg heroBackgroundFragment HtmlFragment notFoundHeroBackgroundFragment
hydrateNotFoundCall out notFoundPageHtml HtmlDocument

writeNotFoundCall is call
writeNotFoundCall in notFoundPageHandler
writeNotFoundCall invokes http.responseText
writeNotFoundCall arg response HttpResponse response
writeNotFoundCall arg status HttpStatusCode notFoundStatusCode
writeNotFoundCall arg body HtmlDocument notFoundPageHtml
writeNotFoundCall arg contentType HttpContentType htmlContentType
writeNotFoundCall out writeNotFoundStatus Int32
